  "body": "The HTML Standard uses the creator Document concept for aliasing origin and referrer. Neither should really require the creator Document to be kept alive if there's no reason for it to exist anymore, but that's an optimization an implementation can make. We could point that out in a note.\n\nSee https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-secure-contexts/issues/18#issuecomment-191780205 for context.\n",
